# Descriptor: [B- -> anti-D_2*0 l- nu, anti-D_2*0 -> anti-D*0 pi+ pi- pi0] gap mode
# NickName: Bu_D2stlnu_Dst0pipipi_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode; three-pion contribution to semileptonic gap via D_2*(2460).
#   Companion to D0pipipipenu; covers the D* pi pi pi final state from D_2*(2460) as
#   intermediate (proxy for D_2(2800)->D_2*(2460)pi sequential decay).
#   LLSW for B -> D_2* l nu; PHSP for D_2* -> D* pi pi pi sub-decay.
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260519

Alias D2stpipipisig anti-D_2*0
Alias anti-D2stpipipisig D_2*0
ChargeConj D2stpipipisig anti-D2stpipipisig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B-sig B+sig  VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B-sig
0.500 D2stpipipisig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
0.500 D2stpipipisig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.71 -1.6 -0.5 2.9;
Enddecay
CDecay B+sig

Decay D2stpipipisig
1.0   anti-D*0  pi+  pi-  pi0   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-D2stpipipisig

End
